    "content": "Relevant context:\n## Gelida EMS: \nA multifunctional device combining cryolipolysis and EMS (Electrical Muscle Stimulation) for body shaping and muscle building. Ofan BeautyGelida Cryo: A cryotherapy device designed for fat reduction and skin tightening through the application of cold temperatures.\n## Cryo 21:\n A non-invasive cryotherapy machine that reduces fat by lowering the temperature of targeted areas, leading to fat cell apoptosis and natural elimination.\n An advanced cryotherapy device offering body sculpting and facial treatments by applying temperatures as low as -20°C, combined with infrared technology. \n\n## GelidaWaves 21: \nA device utilizing specific wave frequencies for therapeutic treatments,aiding in pain relief and muscle relaxation. IO S21 for Fitness Centres: A specialized device designed for fitness centers, offering cryotherapy or related treatments to enhance athletic performance and recovery.\n\n## I TECH 21: \nA holistic treatment device, possibly integrating various technologies for comprehensive wellness and aesthetic applications.\n\n## TouchSkin 21: \nA device aimed at skin treatments, potentially offering solutions for skin rejuvenation, tightening, or other dermatological applications.\n\n## IOS 21:\n A device designed for gyms, possibly providing cryotherapy or similar treatments to support fitness and recovery.\n\n## Waves 21: \n Benefits to Treatments: Highlights the advantages of using the Waves 21 device in various therapeutic treatments, such as enhanced efficacy and patient outcomes.\n\n## IO S21 for Gyms: \nA device tailored for gym environments, offering treatments to aid in muscle recovery and overall athletic performce. \n\n## Itech 21 device \nThese product is designed to offer a range of aesthetic and therapeutic treatments, including fat reduction, skin rejuvenation, muscle stimulation, and overall wellness enhancements.\n\n## Gelida EMS 2 \nThe Gelida EMS 2 device is designed for body and facial treatments through muscle stimulation. Its user protocols cover manual isometric treatments for specific body and facial areas, microcurrent therapy for lifting and toning, and automatic treatments targeting slimming, firming, and anti-stress effects. Specialized programs address areas such as the double chin, drainage, and firming of specific body parts like arms, legs, and back. The device is manufactured in Italy and distributed by Gelida Medica Ltd., focusing on professional wellness and aesthetic applications.\n\n## Gelida CRYO\nThe GELIDA CRYO device is a cryo-lipolysis machine designed for localized fat reduction and therapeutic treatments using controlled cooling technology. It is intended for professional use in aesthetic and therapeutic settings.Key Features:Cryo-Lipolysis: Targets fat reduction through precise cooling.Therapeutic Uses: Offers protocols for muscle strain, back pain, migraines, acne, and more.User Interface: Includes a settings menu for language and treatment area selection.Treatment Protocols: Includes facial, body, and targeted therapeutic applications (e.g., sciatica, sinusitis). Accessories: Requires specific gels for optimal performance, such as soothing and firming gels:"
