2025-02-04 18:16:09 [info]: 	[R1Client:c85nba] Received response: {
  "contentLength": 951,
  "firstLine": "Cryo 21 is a non-invasive cryotherapy machine designed for fat reduction by lowering the temperature of targeted areas on the body. This process induces fat cell apoptosis, which leads to the natural elimination of fat tissue from the body. It also offers advanced body sculpting and facial treatments by applying temperatures as low as -20°C, often combined with infrared technology for enhanced effectiveness. This innovative treatment is commonly used in aesthetic and wellness settings for its ability to improve body contouring and skin appearance while being non-surgical and relatively painless. "
}
